# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
# Env files are ignored by default — they hold machine-specific values.
.env*
# ...except these two, which are release/setup artifacts and carry no secrets.
# .env.production holds VITE_BUILD_NUMBER: the build number must be reviewable
# in the diff and present on a fresh clone, or `npm run build` fails there.
# See "OMS Backend/docs/RELEASE.md" -> "React web release process".
!.env.example
!.env.production

